@startuml 003-discovery-seq-search
title Room Search & Filter Sequence

actor "Guest/Customer" as User
participant "DiscoveryController" as Ctrl
participant "DiscoveryService" as Svc
database "Database" as DB

User -> Ctrl: GET /api/v1/rooms?checkIn=...&capacity=...
activate Ctrl

Ctrl -> Svc: searchRooms(criteria)
activate Svc

Svc -> DB: findAvailableRooms(criteria)
note right of Svc: DB query filters by Property ACTIVE,\nRoom NOT IN Maintenance,\nCapacity check,\nPrice range
activate DB
DB --> Svc: Page<Room>
deactivate DB

alt Dates Provided (checkIn/checkOut)
    loop For each Room
        Svc -> DB: check overlap Bookings(roomId, dates)
        activate DB
        DB --> Svc: Overlapping Bookings List
        deactivate DB
        
        alt Has Blocking Overlap
            Svc -> Svc: Exclude Room from Results
        end
    end
end

Svc -> Svc: Map to RoomListItem DTOs (attach Primary Image)

Svc --> Ctrl: Page<RoomListItem>
deactivate Svc

Ctrl --> User: 200 OK (Paginated Room List)
deactivate Ctrl
@enduml
